<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Seu-Del-Districte-De-Nou-Barris on Blog de Pocallum — camera &amp; action!</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/tag/seu-del-districte-de-nou-barris/</link><description>Recent content in Seu-Del-Districte-De-Nou-Barris on Blog de Pocallum — camera &amp; action!</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ca</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 12 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0200</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/tag/seu-del-districte-de-nou-barris/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>2023-07-08 – Festival de Blues de Barcelona – Chris Cane</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/07/12/2023-07-08-festival-de-blues-de-barcelona-chris-cane/</link><pubDate>Wed, 12 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/07/12/2023-07-08-festival-de-blues-de-barcelona-chris-cane/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/sou3s8PmwipStVQq8"&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/2023-07-07-Chris-Cane-LeicaM6-0266-1024x637.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chris Cane. Res més a dir. Un dels grans per galons i per mèrits.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2023-07-07 - Festival de Blues de Barcelona - Chino Swingslide Trio</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/07/11/2023-07-07-festival-de-blues-de-barcelona-chino-swingslide-trio/</link><pubDate>Tue, 11 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/07/11/2023-07-07-festival-de-blues-de-barcelona-chino-swingslide-trio/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/apEEyGfJqAx1HKaz7"&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/2023-07-07-Chino-Swingslide-Trio-LeicaM6-0037-1024x633.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;El Gran Chino, xinès pels amics, amb el seu trio (&lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/freddymunoz/"&gt;Freddy Muñoz&lt;/a&gt; al baix i &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/homerotolosa/"&gt;Homero Tolosa&lt;/a&gt; a la bateria). No podia faltar tampoc en aquesta edició del Festival de Blues de Barcelona. A més, va anar de gira per les centres penitenciaris i va amenitzar la Jam Session del castell de Torra Baró.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2023-07-07 - Festival de Blues de Barcelona - Tori Sparks feat Big Dani Pérez</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/07/11/2023-07-07-festival-de-blues-de-barcelona-tori-sparks-feat-big-dani-perez/</link><pubDate>Tue, 11 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/07/11/2023-07-07-festival-de-blues-de-barcelona-tori-sparks-feat-big-dani-perez/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/WkPMaUNGBwjVAmjr7"&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/2023-07-07-Tori-Sparks-feat-Big-Dani-LeicaM6-0003-1024x683.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La XXI edició del Festival de Blues de Barcelona va iniciar-se amb &lt;a href="https://www.torisparks.com/es/about"&gt;Tori Sparks&lt;/a&gt; i la seva formació de trio. A més, va comptar amb l&amp;rsquo;acompanyament del Saxo d&amp;rsquo;en &lt;a href="https://blog.pocallum.cat/#:~:text=Sparks%20feat%20Big-,Dani%20P%C3%A9rez,-Chino%20Swinglide%20Trio"&gt;Big Dani Pérez&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2023-07-07 – Festival de Blues de Barcelona – Susan Santos</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/07/11/2023-07-07-festival-de-blues-de-barcelona-susan-santos/</link><pubDate>Tue, 11 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/07/11/2023-07-07-festival-de-blues-de-barcelona-susan-santos/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/GhzxJS8k4tzP588R8"&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/2023-07-07-Susan-Santos-LeicaM6-0127-1024x628.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.susansantos.info/"&gt;Susan Santos&lt;/a&gt;! Molt de temps que en sentia parlar. Molt de temps que veia que no parava de tocar arreu, però finalment la vàrem poder gaudir i de quina manera. Potència a la guitarra molt ben acompanyada de secció rítmica. Contundent i sense poder-ne demanar res més. Molt i molt recomanable.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2023-07-08 – Festival de Blues de Barcelona – Betta &amp; The Groovers</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/07/11/2023-07-08-festival-de-blues-de-barcelona-betta-the-groovers/</link><pubDate>Tue, 11 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/07/11/2023-07-08-festival-de-blues-de-barcelona-betta-the-groovers/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/iRVFczLEJyef1t5o8"&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/2023-07-08-2023-07-08-Betta-de-Groovers-0141-1024x618.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2023-07-08 – Festival de Blues de Barcelona – Vanessa Collier</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/07/11/2023-07-08-festival-de-blues-de-barcelona-vanessa-collier/</link><pubDate>Tue, 11 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/07/11/2023-07-08-festival-de-blues-de-barcelona-vanessa-collier/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/W5Vj4qmsYPquG6yh6"&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/2023-07-07-Vanessa-Collier-LeicaM6-0226-1024x635.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Increïble &lt;a href="https://www.vanessacollier.com/"&gt;Vanessa&lt;/a&gt;! Una gran músic que a més de cantar, toca el Saxo i la guitarra elèctrica. Professionalitat i entrega absoluta ella i els seus acompanyants vinguts dels USA. El llistat de premis que ha obtingut diuen molt d&amp;rsquo;ella.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>